      en: ["Wintrange is a part of the commune of Schengen.", "Wintrange Castle was built in the year 1610.", "The village is located in the Moselle Valley, one of Luxembourg's warmest regions.", "The nearby Haff Réimech nature reserve covers over 80 hectares.", "The 'Felsberg' is a protected viticultural site in Wintrange.", "The village features numerous historic wine-grower houses made of stone."],
